By \cite[Remark~B.0.4 and B.0.6]{Prevot07}, neither $\|Q\|_1$ nor $\|Q\|_2$ depends on the choice of $(b_k)_{k\geq1}$. We introduce a third metric on ${\cal L}^{+,\mathrm{sym}}_1(H_r)$ by setting
